sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 利用者
    participant Entry as interactive.py / api_service.py<br/>入口
    participant Evidence as evidence/pipeline.py<br/>共通Evidence層
    participant Runner as fact_modules.py<br/>共通Runner
    box rgb(226, 247, 232) 実装済み事実モジュール（相互に独立）
        participant Range as range.py<br/>Range
        participant Accuracy as accuracy.py<br/>Accuracy
        participant Coherence as coherence.py<br/>Coherence
    end
    participant Evaluation as AI Judge + deliberation.py<br/>評価層

    User->>Entry: 音声を送信 / 選択
    Entry->>Evidence: build(audio_path)
    Evidence->>Evidence: STT・VAD・ポーズ・モーラ<br/>Sudachiトークン化（各1回）
    Evidence-->>Entry: EvidenceBundle v1
    Entry->>Runner: run_fact_modules(evidence)<br/>既定: 実装済み全モジュール

    par Range
        Runner->>Range: 共有LinguisticEvidence
        Range-->>Runner: range_data
    and Accuracy
        Runner->>Accuracy: 共有EvidenceBundle
        Accuracy-->>Runner: accuracy_data
    and Coherence
        Runner->>Coherence: 共有EvidenceBundle
        Coherence-->>Runner: coherence_data
    end

    Runner-->>Entry: FactModuleRun（3パケット）
    Note over Entry,Runner: Fluencyは共通Evidenceの基礎事実として同梱
    Entry->>Evaluation: Fluency + Range + Accuracy + Coherence<br/>すべて客観データ
    Evaluation-->>Entry: CEFR推定・協議結果
    Entry-->>User: 表示 / API応答 / 履歴保存
